<title>USA: Medi-Ject in pact with SmithKline.</title>
<headline>Medi-Ject in pact with SmithKline.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medi-Ject Corp said Wednesday it signed a feasibility agreement with SmithKline Beecham Plc to explore development of new and novel ways to use the Medi-Ject needle-free drug delivery technology for the administration of SmithKline drugs.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement and the identity of the drugs to be tested were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Medi-Ject markets needle-free systems worldwide.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
